     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">I guess there are a lot of things going on within the warming up iterations. If I set warmup=3, iteration=10, the whole process takes about 20 seconds. However, if I set warmup=30, iteration=130, the total time is not 20*10 seconds, and actually, the first 13 warmups took several minutes, and after a long time, the second 13 warmups is still running now. </div><div dir=\"ltr\"><br></div><div dir=\"ltr\">And I notice that for the 10 iterations, the parameters don&#39;t even update. They are having the same values for all the iterations.<br><div><br></div><div>Thanks to Ben Goodrich&#39;s link to a paper implementing Kronecker product, my model seems having more hope to run, at least for the 10 iterations. However, it stuck again if I tried to have a longer iteration number with more warmups.</div><div><br></div><div>Is there a problem with my code, or it&#39;s just the model&#39;s problem, like, the number of parameters I have.</div><div><br></div><div><div style=\"border:1px solid rgb(187,187,187);word-wrap:break-word;background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">functions </span><span style=\"color:#660\">{</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#800\">// return (A \\otimes B) v where:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#800\">// A is n1 x n1, B = n2 x n2, V = n2 x n1 = reshape(v,n2,n1)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>matrix kron_mvprod</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">matrix A</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> matrix B</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> matrix V</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">{</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#008\">return</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> transpose</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">A </span><span style=\"color:#660\">*</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> transpose</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">B </span><span style=\"color:#660\">*</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> V</span><span style=\"color:#660\">));</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">}</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">}</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br><br>data</span><span style=\"color:#660\">{</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  </span><span style=\"color:#008\">int</span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;</span><span style=\"color:#000\">lower</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">&gt;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> I</span><span style=\"color:#660\">;</span><span style=\"color:#800\">//counties</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  </span><span style=\"color:#008\">int</span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;</span><span style=\"color:#000\">lower</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">&gt;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> T</span><span style=\"color:#660\">;</span><span style=\"color:#800\">//time periods</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  </span><span style=\"color:#008\">int</span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;</span><span style=\"color:#000\">lower</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">&gt;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> K</span><span style=\"color:#660\">;</span><span style=\"color:#800\">//genders</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  </span><span style=\"color:#008\">int</span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;</span><span style=\"color:#000\">lower</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">&gt;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> J</span><span style=\"color:#660\">;</span><span style=\"color:#800\">//age groups</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  <br>  matrix</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">I</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">I</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#606\">Cmatrix</span><span style=\"color:#660\">;</span><span style=\"color:#800\">//adjacency matrix</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  matrix</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">I</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">I</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#606\">Identity</span><span style=\"color:#660\">;</span><span style=\"color:#800\">//Identity matrix</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  real max_rho</span><span style=\"color:#660\">;</span><span style=\"color:#800\">//upper boundary of rho,to make precision matrix p.d.</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  matrix</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">K</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">K</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> W</span><span style=\"color:#660\">;</span><span style=\"color:#800\">//prior of SIGMA</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  vector</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">I</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">lambda</span><span style=\"color:#660\">;</span><span style=\"color:#800\">//eigens of Cmatrix</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  vector</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">I</span><span style=\"color:#660\">*</span><span style=\"color:#000\">T</span><span style=\"color:#660\">*</span><span style=\"color:#000\">K</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> n</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">J</span><span style=\"color:#660\">];</span><span style=\"color:#800\">//obsed population</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  </span><span style=\"color:#800\">//vector[I*T*K] y[J];//obsed data</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  </span><span style=\"color:#008\">int</span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;</span><span style=\"color:#000\">lower</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#066\">0</span><span style=\"color:#660\">&gt;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> y</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">J</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">I</span><span style=\"color:#660\">*</span><span style=\"color:#000\">T</span><span style=\"color:#660\">*</span><span style=\"color:#000\">K</span><span style=\"color:#660\">];</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  matrix</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">T</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">T</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> A</span><span style=\"color:#660\">;</span><span style=\"color:#800\">//temporal smoothing matrix</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">}</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>transformed data</span><span style=\"color:#660\">{</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  </span><span style=\"color:#008\">int</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> KT</span><span style=\"color:#660\">;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  KT </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> K</span><span style=\"color:#660\">*</span><span style=\"color:#000\">T</span><span style=\"color:#660\">;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">}</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>parameters</span><span style=\"color:#660\">{</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  matrix</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">I</span><span style=\"color:#6