inv</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#066\">2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#066\">2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> SIGMA</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">j</span><span style=\"color:#660\">][</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]/</span><span style=\"color:#000\">dinominator</span><span style=\"color:#660\">;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br><br>    </span><span style=\"color:#800\">//first product</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    </span><span style=\"color:#008\">for</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">d1 </span><span style=\"color:#008\">in</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\">K</span><span style=\"color:#660\">){</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>      </span><span style=\"color:#008\">for</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">d2 </span><span style=\"color:#008\">in</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\">K</span><span style=\"color:#660\">){</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>        </span><span style=\"color:#008\">for</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">s1 </span><span style=\"color:#008\">in</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\">T</span><span style=\"color:#660\">){</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>          </span><span style=\"color:#008\">for</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">s2 </span><span style=\"color:#008\">in</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\">T</span><span style=\"color:#660\">){</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>            first_product</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">d1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)*</span><span style=\"color:#000\">T</span><span style=\"color:#660\">+</span><span style=\"color:#000\">s1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">d2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)*</span><span style=\"color:#000\">T</span><span style=\"color:#660\">+</span><span style=\"color:#000\">s2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> sig_inv</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">d1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">d2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]*</span><span style=\"color:#000\">A</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">s1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">s2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">];</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>          </span><span style=\"color:#660\">}</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>        </span><span style=\"color:#660\">}</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>        <br>      </span><span style=\"color:#660\">}</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    </span><span style=\"color:#660\">}</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    log_rho</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">j</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">0.5</span><span style=\"color:#660\">*</span><span style=\"color:#000\">sum</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#000\">rho</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">j</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]*</span><span style=\"color:#008\">lambda</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)*(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">T</span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#066\">2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)*</span><span style=\"color:#000\">K</span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#066\">0.5</span><span style=\"color:#660\">*</span><span style=\"color:#000\">sum</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">Z</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">j</span><span style=\"color:#660\">].*</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> kron_mvprod</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">first_product</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> B</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> Z</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">j</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]));</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  </span><span style=\"color:#660\">}</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  <br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">}</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br><br><br>model</span><span style=\"color:#660\">{</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  delta0 </span><span style=\"color:#660\">~</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> inv_gamma</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#066\">2.0</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">0.005</span><span style=\"color:#660\">);</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  </span><span style=\"color:#008\">for</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">j </span><span style=\"color:#008\">in</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\">J</span><span style=\"color:#660\">){</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    rho</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">j</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">~</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> uniform</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#066\">0</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> max_rho</span><span style=\"color:#660\">);</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    SIGMA</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">j</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">~</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> inv_wishart</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#066\">2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">W</span><span style=\"color:#660\">);</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    increment_log_prob</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">log_rho</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">j</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]);</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    vec_V</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">j</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">~</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> normal</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">vec_Z</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">j</span><span style=\"color:#660\">],</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> delta0</span><span style=\"color:#660\">);</span><span style=\"color:#800\">//this can be improved with std normal then transforming</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    y</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">j</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">~</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> poisson_log</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">log_possion_mean</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">j</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]);</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  </span><span style=\"color:#660\">}</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">}</span></div></code></div><div><br></div></div><div>Well it has a warning, but I suppose I can neglect it. I&#39;m just doing a reshaping for the matrix to vector.</div><div><div style=\"border:1px solid rgb(187,187,187);word-wrap:break-word;background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#660\">&gt;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> fit </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> stan</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">file </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;FullModel.stan&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> data </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> CRC_data</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">+</span><span style=\"color:#000\">             iter </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">130</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> warmup</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#066\">30</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> chains </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> init</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">list</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">init_data</span><span style=\"color:#660\">))</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>DIAGNOSTIC</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">S</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> FROM PARSER</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#606\">Warning</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">non</span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#000\">fatal</span><span style=\"color:#660\">):</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#606\">Left</span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#000\">hand side of sampling statement </span><span style=\"color:#660\">(~)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> may contain a non</span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#000\">linear transform of a parameter </span><span style=\"color:#008\">or</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">local</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> variable</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#606\">If</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> so</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> you need to call increment_log_prob</span><span style=\"color:#660\">()</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">with</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> the log absolute determinant of the </span><span style=\"color:#606\">Jacobian</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> of the transform</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#606\">Left</span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#000\">hand</span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#000\">side of sampling statement</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    vec_V</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">j</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">~</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> normal</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(...)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span><br><div><font color=\"#000000\">SAMPLING FOR MODEL &#39;FullModel&#39; NOW (CHAIN 1).</font></div><div><font color=\"#000000\"><br></font></div><div><font color=\"#000000\">Chain 1, Iteration:   1 / 130 [  0%]  (Warmup)</font></div><div><font color=\"#000000\">Chain 1, Iteration:  13 / 130 [ 10%]  (Warmup) </font></div></span></div></code></div><div>And it stopped here. </div></div></div>"
